WEBVTT

00:01.750 --> 00:04.290
All right! Today's the day
you've all been waiting for...

00:04.290 --> 00:06.830
Pool cleaning!

00:08.450 --> 00:10.250
Not a cloud in the sky!

00:10.250 --> 00:11.410
What a perfect day!

00:11.410 --> 00:12.410
Totally!

00:12.410 --> 00:14.830
No clouds, and we're in Japan!

00:16.079 --> 00:18.040
The president sure is fired up.

00:18.040 --> 00:21.200
She's always loved sports.

00:21.200 --> 00:22.950
She used to be on the track team, after all.

00:22.950 --> 00:25.290
Speaking of which, where's Otori?

00:26.120 --> 00:28.080
(- Hey! We've got club activities today!)
(- My blanket's too heavy. I'm gonna be late!)

02:01.000 --> 02:04.000
(Episode 3: Pool Cleaning in Swimsuits!)

02:04.160 --> 02:06.080
Hey, you must be Ume!

02:06.080 --> 02:08.250
Thanks for coming to help.

02:08.410 --> 02:09.160
You got it!

02:09.160 --> 02:10.449
You're from the Swimming Club...?

02:10.449 --> 02:11.200
Yep!

02:11.200 --> 02:12.790
(Kuroe Honma, Third-Year High School Student)
The Swimming Club!

02:12.790 --> 02:14.000
Isn't that redundant?

02:14.000 --> 02:15.790
I'm Kuroe Honma, a third-year.

02:15.790 --> 02:19.410
They call me the Tuna of Fujinari!

02:19.410 --> 02:22.080
Just call me Tuna!

02:22.080 --> 02:24.160
Uh, that's a bit...

02:24.160 --> 02:25.620
She's got no filter.

02:25.620 --> 02:27.540
And my best feature

02:27.540 --> 02:28.950
is this soleus muscle right here!

02:28.950 --> 02:30.620
A tuna with soleus muscles!

02:30.620 --> 02:32.330
Get it? Good pun, right?

02:32.330 --> 02:33.870
Whoa! Wait, wait, wait!

02:33.870 --> 02:35.540
You're showing way too much!

02:37.660 --> 02:39.950
All right, let's get in there.

02:40.120 --> 02:42.830
Watch your step. It's pretty slippery!

02:43.830 --> 02:45.950
Yep, it's slippery!

02:46.290 --> 02:47.870
Yeah...

02:47.870 --> 02:50.750
Ooh, it's all slimy! Feels great!

02:52.330 --> 02:53.250
Ume?

02:53.250 --> 02:54.160
Yes!

02:54.160 --> 02:55.870
I'll get scrubbing!

02:58.790 --> 03:00.000
What's wrong, Michinoku?

03:00.000 --> 03:01.500
Why are you shaking like that?

03:01.500 --> 03:02.830
I'm holding on...

03:03.040 --> 03:04.160
What do you mean?

03:04.160 --> 03:07.540
If I move even a little...

03:12.830 --> 03:14.000
this happens.

03:14.250 --> 03:16.200
Terrible balance.

03:20.250 --> 03:23.080
What are you doing, Terui?

03:23.250 --> 03:25.830
Collecting dragonfly larvae.

03:25.830 --> 03:27.250
They're called naiads.

03:28.160 --> 03:31.620
If we leave them here,
they'll get washed away and die.

03:31.790 --> 03:34.160
That'd be so sad.

03:34.160 --> 03:35.660
Terui...

03:35.830 --> 03:37.160
You're so kind.

03:37.160 --> 03:39.160
Are you taking them home to raise them?

03:39.160 --> 03:40.750
Oh, no.

03:40.750 --> 03:42.620
I'm feeding them to my tropical fish.

03:42.910 --> 03:45.540
Better than dying for nothing, right?

03:45.540 --> 03:48.580
So you only care how they die?

03:51.370 --> 03:53.750
The grime won't come off.

03:54.370 --> 03:55.750
I've got detergent!

03:55.750 --> 03:58.080
(Pool Cleaner)
Seriously? You're a lifesaver!

03:58.750 --> 04:01.160
Then pour some over there!

04:03.130 --> 04:03.570
(Slip!)

04:07.250 --> 04:09.000
Please don't die...

04:09.000 --> 04:11.200
(All Dragonfly Larvae Wiped Out)
All Dragonfly Larvae Wiped Out.

04:12.120 --> 04:14.660
This is hard work.

04:17.290 --> 04:18.950
Nice work.

04:18.950 --> 04:20.620
Look at you all, hard at work!

04:20.620 --> 04:22.580
Good job, good job!

04:22.580 --> 04:24.910
Late again, like some big shot.

04:25.250 --> 04:26.200
Ume.

04:26.200 --> 04:28.330
You and that scrub brush look great together!

04:28.330 --> 04:29.250
Huh?

04:29.250 --> 04:30.620
You're not wearing a school swimsuit?

04:30.620 --> 04:32.000
Well, obviously not!

04:32.000 --> 04:35.750
I never intended to dress like a girl!

04:35.750 --> 04:36.660
Really?

04:36.660 --> 04:39.540
Hey! It's the kid from that swimsuit photo!

04:39.540 --> 04:41.660
Why aren't you wearing one?

04:41.660 --> 04:42.910
Why not?

04:43.950 --> 04:45.500
Like I said,

04:45.500 --> 04:48.000
Arisu forced me into it!

04:48.000 --> 04:49.330
It wasn't mine!

04:49.330 --> 04:51.830
Oh, really? My bad!

04:51.830 --> 04:53.660
You can borrow mine, then!

04:53.660 --> 04:55.000
Our club's broke!

04:55.000 --> 04:56.290
That's not the point!

04:56.490 --> 04:57.290
(Almost Done)

04:57.450 --> 04:59.660
(Almost Done)
Man, I'm beat.

04:59.660 --> 05:02.580
One final rinse, and we're done!

05:02.580 --> 05:05.330
I'll turn on the water!

05:05.330 --> 05:07.910
Always picking the easy jobs!

05:07.910 --> 05:09.950
We'll do the scrubbing.

05:09.950 --> 05:11.160
You take the hose.

05:13.000 --> 05:14.660
Huh? The water?

05:14.660 --> 05:17.040
Feels like I'm forgetting something...

05:17.040 --> 05:17.910
Here goes!

05:24.870 --> 05:27.290
(Just Remembered)
Oh, right! The hose is broken!

05:27.290 --> 05:28.080
Hey!

05:28.080 --> 05:29.870
It's coming out like crazy!

05:29.870 --> 05:31.250
Otori! Turn it off!

05:31.250 --> 05:34.540
No good. He's listening to music
with that smug look on his face.

05:37.200 --> 05:38.700
Damn it...

05:38.700 --> 05:40.540
Somebody shut off the water!

05:42.950 --> 05:45.040
Ah! Wait...

05:45.290 --> 05:46.580
Sorry, Mizunoe!

05:46.580 --> 05:47.660
I'll shut it off.

05:47.660 --> 05:49.370
No! I'll go!

05:49.370 --> 05:50.450
Sorry!

05:50.450 --> 05:51.870
What's going on?

05:51.870 --> 05:53.830
Playing in the water?

05:54.000 --> 05:56.000
Today's Punishment for Otori:

05:56.000 --> 05:57.330
(Waterwheel Torture)
Waterwheel Torture!

05:57.330 --> 05:59.790
At least the club budget's looking up!

06:04.120 --> 06:06.450
Maybe we went a bit too far.

06:06.450 --> 06:08.700
Tan seems to have caught a cold.

06:08.700 --> 06:10.500
They say idiots never catch colds,

06:10.500 --> 06:12.700
but apparently trash does.

06:12.700 --> 06:15.040
I'd normally go myself,

06:15.040 --> 06:18.000
but now that we have another boy, Ume,

06:18.000 --> 06:20.950
could you pay him a visit?

06:21.250 --> 06:22.290
Besides,

06:22.290 --> 06:24.080
I bet there's something you want to see, too.

06:24.130 --> 06:25.580
(The Student Council Has Me Too! -- Tan Otori)
(Bringing You Dreams and Love)

06:25.580 --> 06:26.790
See what?

06:28.890 --> 06:30.670
(STOP)

06:32.660 --> 06:35.040
So this is where Otori lives.

06:35.250 --> 06:38.660
Hard to picture him looking helpless.

06:40.540 --> 06:41.540
Okay.

06:46.450 --> 06:48.000
Coming!

06:50.330 --> 06:52.160
Who is it?

06:54.040 --> 06:55.000
Hey.

06:55.000 --> 06:57.250
Huh? Ume?

06:57.250 --> 06:58.450
Yep.

06:58.450 --> 07:00.410
I heard you were out sick today.

07:00.410 --> 07:02.120
I brought over some student council paperwork.

07:02.120 --> 07:03.370
Could it be...

07:04.370 --> 07:06.080
Did you miss me that much...?

07:07.450 --> 07:09.200
Geez, what am I gonna do with you?

07:09.200 --> 07:11.790
- Still teasing me when you're this sick?
- Honestly...

07:11.790 --> 07:12.910
Don't push yourself.

07:14.870 --> 07:18.330
Ugh, stupid cold germs...

07:18.330 --> 07:20.910
If I could see them, I'd beat them up!

07:20.910 --> 07:22.870
Just lie down and rest!

07:22.870 --> 07:25.450
Have some porridge. I made it at home.

07:25.870 --> 07:28.530
You need to eat properly when you're sick.

07:29.370 --> 07:30.700
Ume!

07:31.540 --> 07:33.450
You didn't put scallions in it, did you?

07:33.450 --> 07:37.200
My delicate palate can't stand anything bitter.

07:37.870 --> 07:39.330
Hot! Hot! Hot!

07:42.580 --> 07:45.830
He's got plenty of energy left.

07:46.080 --> 07:48.000
Ume...

07:48.370 --> 07:49.660
What is it?

07:49.660 --> 07:50.790
Um...

07:51.080 --> 07:53.370
What's wrong? Feeling worse?

07:53.690 --> 07:54.660
(Rub, Rub)

07:55.450 --> 07:58.450
I rubbed my cold germs all over you!

07:58.450 --> 07:59.750
(Annoyed)

07:59.750 --> 08:02.450
What the hell? I'm sick, you know!

08:02.450 --> 08:03.830
Then stay still and rest.

08:04.290 --> 08:07.000
I can't move!

08:07.000 --> 08:09.540
My butt itches, Ume!

08:09.540 --> 08:11.120
Looks like he's feeling much better.

08:11.120 --> 08:12.580
Maybe I should just go home.

08:13.410 --> 08:14.750
But...

08:15.750 --> 08:18.870
Wait, do you live alone?

08:19.080 --> 08:20.290
Yeah.

08:20.750 --> 08:23.660
I don't have parents, after all.

08:23.660 --> 08:25.660
What? Why...?

08:25.660 --> 08:29.330
Family stuff, I guess...

08:29.500 --> 08:31.910
Before I knew it, Dad was gone.

08:31.910 --> 08:34.700
Mom never comes home, either.

08:34.700 --> 08:35.950
So...

08:36.909 --> 08:39.330
Thanks for checking on me today.

08:41.000 --> 08:42.330
Just kidding!

08:42.330 --> 08:43.500
I'm invincible, you know!

08:43.500 --> 08:45.290
I can handle anything on my own!

08:45.290 --> 08:46.330
This cold'll be gone in no time...

08:46.330 --> 08:47.450
Otori.

08:48.330 --> 08:51.660
Have you even seen a doctor?

08:51.870 --> 08:52.580
No...

08:52.580 --> 08:53.750
I thought so.

08:54.040 --> 08:56.160
You can't just leave this untreated!

08:56.160 --> 08:58.700
And I bet you haven't taken your medicine, either.

08:58.910 --> 09:01.000
It's on that shelf.

09:01.000 --> 09:02.250
But...

09:02.250 --> 09:03.250
Is this it?

09:03.250 --> 09:04.890
Otori, I'm going to make you better.

09:04.890 --> 09:06.200
(Oronaru, 2 Tablets per Dose)
Otori, I'm going to make you better.

09:07.200 --> 09:09.330
(Headache, Fever, Menstrual Cramps)
Those are suppositories...

09:10.660 --> 09:11.580
Otori.

09:12.330 --> 09:13.660
Take your pants off.

09:14.080 --> 09:14.950
Wait! You're not seriously...

09:14.950 --> 09:16.870
I can do it myself!

09:16.870 --> 09:18.000
No.

09:18.000 --> 09:20.580
You'd probably just pretend you did.

09:21.370 --> 09:22.700
Let me handle it.

09:24.160 --> 09:25.500
But...

09:26.910 --> 09:28.450
It's embarrassing!

09:30.370 --> 09:32.250
Nothing to be embarrassed about!

09:32.410 --> 09:34.790
He's trying to drown out his nerves by shouting.

09:37.830 --> 09:40.620
All right, here goes.

09:40.910 --> 09:41.910
Okay...

09:49.290 --> 09:50.410
Ow!

09:50.790 --> 09:51.790
Sorry!

09:52.330 --> 09:53.750
I'm okay.

09:55.700 --> 09:57.700
Keep going.

09:57.900 --> 09:59.500
(No Longer Human, Naomi, Confessions of a Mask)
(Botchan, The Temple of the Golden Pavilion)

09:59.580 --> 10:03.130
Mizunoe's lost in a world of fiction.

10:06.910 --> 10:08.870
I'm exhausted...

10:08.870 --> 10:11.370
I thought my heart was gonna explode!

10:11.370 --> 10:12.660
There. It's in.

10:13.410 --> 10:17.250
At least Otori seems to have settled down.

10:19.370 --> 10:21.080
Ume...

10:26.120 --> 10:27.620
I'd better go.

10:27.790 --> 10:29.790
I'll leave your medicine here...

10:31.040 --> 10:33.410
The suppository's on the floor?

10:33.830 --> 10:34.830
Wait...

10:35.450 --> 10:38.370
Then what did I just put in there?

10:38.370 --> 10:40.830
(Fresh Mint Tablets! For Fresh Breath!)

10:44.660 --> 10:47.410
Why does my butt feel warm?

10:47.410 --> 10:48.450
Otori!

10:49.910 --> 10:51.290
Show me your butt!

10:52.410 --> 10:53.950
What?!

10:53.950 --> 10:54.540
Ume!

10:54.540 --> 10:56.910
Huh? It's hot!

10:56.910 --> 10:57.910
My butt's burning!

10:57.910 --> 10:58.750
It's hot!

10:58.750 --> 10:59.830
My butt's on fire!

10:59.830 --> 11:01.580
I'm sorry! This is my fault!

11:01.580 --> 11:03.620
Now hurry up and show me your butt!

11:05.040 --> 11:05.950
The next day,

11:05.950 --> 11:08.040
Mizunoe caught a cold, too.

11:08.040 --> 11:11.230
(The Following Week)
Hey. Feeling better now?

11:11.910 --> 11:13.160
More or less.

11:30.790 --> 11:33.790
(Episode 3: Good for You!)

11:33.790 --> 11:33.800
Shake...

11:33.800 --> 11:36.660
(Student Council Room)
Shake...

11:36.660 --> 11:36.710
- Woof!
- Shake...
(Student Council Room)

11:36.710 --> 11:37.700
- Woof!
- Shake...

11:37.730 --> 11:39.480
(Mathematics I)

11:39.660 --> 11:41.120
What's wrong, Mizunoe?

11:41.120 --> 11:42.790
Why the sudden sigh?

11:43.290 --> 11:47.000
Nothing. It's just
they're making us do it again.

11:47.000 --> 11:48.540
(Ridiculous!)
Regular exams!

11:48.700 --> 11:51.790
Well, of course! They're called
regular exams for a reason!

11:51.790 --> 11:53.370
Come to think of it, Mizunoe,

11:53.370 --> 11:55.700
you're not great at math and science, are you?

11:55.700 --> 11:57.450
Exactly.

11:57.450 --> 11:59.660
It's like talking to a brick wall...

11:59.660 --> 12:00.910
No, preaching to a cow...

12:00.910 --> 12:04.080
No, playing music to a cow...

12:04.080 --> 12:06.410
No need to get so fancy with your words.

12:06.410 --> 12:08.830
But you're so good at Japanese.

12:09.250 --> 12:11.910
How bad are you in each subject?

12:11.910 --> 12:13.500
Let's see...

12:14.120 --> 12:18.200
Which subjects count as science again?

12:18.200 --> 12:19.790
Mathematics?

12:19.790 --> 12:21.250
Chemistry?

12:21.250 --> 12:22.620
You're starting from there?!

12:22.620 --> 12:24.000
Sorry.

12:24.000 --> 12:26.660
It's more that I hate them
than that I'm bad at them.

12:26.660 --> 12:29.410
No matter how hard I study, nothing sticks.

12:29.410 --> 12:30.950
I see.

12:31.250 --> 12:33.200
All right. I know what to do.

12:34.160 --> 12:36.120
What's on the test?

12:36.370 --> 12:39.120
I actually like math and science.

12:39.120 --> 12:42.120
Maybe studying together
will make you hate them less.

12:42.120 --> 12:43.580
President!

12:44.290 --> 12:47.370
By the way, how are your grades?

12:47.370 --> 12:49.080
If you don't mind me asking.

12:50.750 --> 12:52.370
Well...

12:52.580 --> 12:56.160
I come first in our year now and then.

12:56.160 --> 12:57.660
Seriously?!

12:57.660 --> 13:00.290
But I'm only around fifth
in each individual subject.

13:00.290 --> 13:01.790
Jack of all trades, master of none.

13:01.790 --> 13:04.040
That's still incredible!

13:04.040 --> 13:06.410
With all your student council work, too!

13:06.410 --> 13:09.250
You're amazing, President!

13:09.250 --> 13:10.910
Even if you are a closet per... Never mind.

13:10.910 --> 13:13.450
Kotobuki scores an unexpected point!

13:13.450 --> 13:15.290
Let's get started.

13:15.290 --> 13:16.200
Right!

13:17.120 --> 13:19.200
Studying, are we?

13:19.450 --> 13:21.660
We'll give you a hand.

13:21.660 --> 13:24.660
What?! Are we looking after Ume now?!

13:24.660 --> 13:26.620
Great. Here come the extras.

13:26.830 --> 13:28.910
Exams are coming up, after all.

13:28.910 --> 13:32.790
I was wondering how you were doing in science.

13:33.080 --> 13:34.410
You knew?

13:34.410 --> 13:35.700
How embarrassing...

13:35.700 --> 13:38.000
Last time, you got 13 in science,

13:38.000 --> 13:40.830
4 in math, and 18 in biology.

13:41.370 --> 13:44.790
Let's at least try to avoid failing this time.

13:44.790 --> 13:46.410
You know way too much about me!

13:46.750 --> 13:50.370
I'll take biology and chemistry, then.

13:50.870 --> 13:52.450
Really?

13:52.450 --> 13:54.950
(Basic Biology) (Basic Chemistry)
Believe it or not, I'm pretty good at them.

13:54.950 --> 13:58.000
I even won an award at the IBO.

13:58.000 --> 13:59.410
She's a monster!

13:59.700 --> 14:00.870
The IBO is the International Biology Olympiad,

14:00.870 --> 14:04.870
a worldwide competition for high school students.

14:04.870 --> 14:08.450
Actually, that does sound like you...

14:08.660 --> 14:10.410
Just as you imagined...?

14:11.790 --> 14:13.540
Thanks!

14:13.540 --> 14:15.620
I do love living things, you know.

14:15.620 --> 14:17.750
Uh, right.

14:17.750 --> 14:19.160
What a relief...

14:19.410 --> 14:22.120
So you were this close to repeating a year, Ume?

14:22.120 --> 14:24.450
And you wear glasses! Hilarious!

14:24.450 --> 14:25.660
Will you shut up?!

14:25.950 --> 14:27.870
You're still in middle school, aren't you?

14:27.870 --> 14:30.290
High school exams are tough!

14:30.290 --> 14:31.660
Go play somewhere, kid.

14:31.660 --> 14:32.370
Well, actually,

14:32.620 --> 14:36.040
Tan's already doing college-level computer
science and physics.

14:36.040 --> 14:37.950
He even develops software.

14:37.950 --> 14:39.080
What?!

14:39.870 --> 14:42.580
Who's the kid now?

14:42.580 --> 14:45.200
Shave your head and beg me to teach you!

14:45.200 --> 14:47.080
You mean "bow your head"...

14:47.410 --> 14:49.620
That's going too far!

14:49.620 --> 14:54.200
Anyway, science seems covered.

14:54.450 --> 14:56.000
But math...

14:56.000 --> 14:57.870
Well...

14:57.870 --> 14:59.250
Math?

14:59.410 --> 15:01.410
I'm good at math.

15:02.330 --> 15:05.290
You, Michinoku...?

15:05.290 --> 15:06.370
Yep.

15:06.540 --> 15:08.330
You wouldn't guess it, but she

15:08.330 --> 15:11.040
has a full scholarship for her math talent.

15:11.040 --> 15:12.830
Wait, seriously?!

15:12.830 --> 15:16.370
Then why didn't you say so
when I was worrying about it?

15:16.370 --> 15:17.500
Sorry.

15:17.700 --> 15:19.200
I really needed the bathroom then.

15:19.200 --> 15:20.910
You should've said that sooner!

15:20.990 --> 15:22.490
(Chemistry, Biology, Mathematics)
So

15:22.520 --> 15:25.380
(Computer Science & Physics, All Together)
we've got all the top-ranked science students here!

15:25.660 --> 15:27.160
Looks like it.

15:27.330 --> 15:30.040
Could Ms. Hiratsuka have known
this would happen all along

15:30.040 --> 15:31.660
and put me on the student council for that reason?

15:31.710 --> 15:33.110
Mizunoe!

15:33.290 --> 15:35.620
- She may not seem like it,
- Lend me 100 yen!

15:35.620 --> 15:38.040
but she notices more than you'd think.

15:38.540 --> 15:41.120
Shall we each get started, then?

15:41.120 --> 15:43.540
(Basic Biology)
Yes! Thanks for helping!

15:45.500 --> 15:47.370
It's piecewise smooth,

15:47.370 --> 15:51.790
so the Fourier series converges...
and the boundary conditions...

15:51.790 --> 15:53.790
I don't understand a word.

15:54.040 --> 15:55.080
Toying with...

15:55.080 --> 15:57.540
- The president is sulking like never before!
- Toying with...

15:57.790 --> 15:59.580
No, it's fine...

15:59.580 --> 16:02.330
I'm more of a jack-of-all-trades anyway...

16:02.330 --> 16:03.700
No, no, no!

16:04.830 --> 16:06.750
Wait, there is one!

16:06.750 --> 16:09.290
A subject you ranked first in, President!

16:09.750 --> 16:12.250
Please teach me that one!

16:12.250 --> 16:14.790
You know...

16:15.000 --> 16:16.540
Health and Physical Education.

16:18.910 --> 16:21.620
I'm not that good at it...

16:21.620 --> 16:23.910
No need to be modest!

16:23.910 --> 16:26.580
It's an important subject
that's part of everyday life.

16:26.580 --> 16:28.450
Ume isn't very good at that one, either.

16:28.450 --> 16:30.620
(High School Health and Physical Education)
Why don't you give him a proper lesson?

16:31.790 --> 16:34.450
Uh... well...

16:37.760 --> 16:38.500
(Mumble)

16:38.500 --> 16:38.910
Girls are...
(Mumble)

16:38.910 --> 16:41.040
Girls are...

16:42.370 --> 16:43.660
That's enough, President.

16:43.660 --> 16:45.120
You don't have to force yourself.

16:45.540 --> 16:47.080
We'll leave you to it, then.

16:47.080 --> 16:49.580
Sorry about that, President.

16:51.450 --> 16:55.330
In the end, Kotobuki taught him everything.

16:55.490 --> 16:56.200
(The Next Day)

16:56.200 --> 16:59.160
Two days in a row is pretty rough.
(The Next Day)

16:59.370 --> 17:03.450
Mizunoe lives alone near the school.

17:03.750 --> 17:06.619
(STOP)
But the president's a great teacher.

17:06.619 --> 17:09.200
I even made it to the supermarket sale today!

17:09.200 --> 17:10.290
Nice!

17:12.040 --> 17:14.540
Maybe I'll make some homemade gratin.
It's been a while.

17:17.250 --> 17:18.329
Hey!

17:18.579 --> 17:19.950
Sis?!

17:19.950 --> 17:21.160
And that's my underwear!

17:21.160 --> 17:23.450
That's right. It's your big sister!

17:23.869 --> 17:26.540
(Ume's Older Sister, Matsu Mizunoe)
Sorry, did I scare you?

17:26.700 --> 17:29.830
I had to come back to Japan for work for a while,

17:29.830 --> 17:33.870
so I thought I'd visit
my darling little brother first.

17:34.370 --> 17:35.250
I see.

17:35.250 --> 17:36.750
You could've at least told me!

17:36.750 --> 17:40.660
This one's a pretty big job.

17:40.910 --> 17:44.910
I'm really giving it my all this time.

17:46.290 --> 17:48.790
Aren't you going to praise me?

17:48.790 --> 17:51.370
Well, you can't just spring that on me...

17:51.660 --> 17:52.660
Anyway,

17:52.660 --> 17:55.200
why are you still holding my underwear?

17:56.000 --> 18:00.160
I'm checking whether you're managing on your own.

18:00.160 --> 18:02.040
Starting with your laundry!

18:02.040 --> 18:03.370
Please don't.

18:03.370 --> 18:06.200
Come on, I'm not a little kid anymore!

18:06.750 --> 18:08.000
Sorry!

18:08.410 --> 18:11.660
I worry about my adorable little brother.

18:13.700 --> 18:16.370
That's why I can't get married!

18:16.370 --> 18:17.660
No, that's why you can't get married.

18:17.660 --> 18:18.790
And give that back!

18:19.540 --> 18:20.910
But Ume,

18:20.910 --> 18:23.500
you seem different somehow.

18:24.370 --> 18:25.870
How so?

18:25.870 --> 18:26.910
That's it!

18:27.250 --> 18:30.620
You seem more popular with the girls!

18:30.620 --> 18:32.500
That's what all this was leading up to?!

18:32.500 --> 18:34.700
Wait, Sis, don't tell me...

18:34.700 --> 18:35.790
Yep!

18:36.370 --> 18:38.910
I hacked into your LONE account

18:39.120 --> 18:41.000
and blocked all the girls!

18:41.000 --> 18:43.870
Stop doing that! You always pull this stuff!

18:43.870 --> 18:46.950
My little Ume has women in his life now!

18:46.950 --> 18:48.620
I feel so lonely...

18:48.620 --> 18:51.080
There she goes, getting carried away again...

18:51.080 --> 18:55.330
I miss the days when you had no friends
but pretended you were fine!

18:55.330 --> 18:57.660
You know that's a really mean thing to say, right?

18:58.160 --> 19:01.330
Want to come live with me in America?

19:01.330 --> 19:03.500
Just forget about those girls.

19:03.500 --> 19:05.290
What are you even talking about?!

19:05.620 --> 19:07.000
Hello!

19:08.250 --> 19:09.290
It's Ume!

19:09.290 --> 19:10.790
Hi there!

19:11.290 --> 19:13.290
What brings you here?

19:13.290 --> 19:14.500
Sorry to drop by like this.

19:14.500 --> 19:16.540
We wanted to meet outside,

19:16.540 --> 19:18.450
but we couldn't get hold of you.

19:18.450 --> 19:20.290
Go on, Komaro!

19:20.790 --> 19:23.450
I made this cake in home ec class.

19:23.950 --> 19:27.200
She wanted to give it to you
but couldn't work up the nerve.

19:27.200 --> 19:28.620
It turned out really well.

19:28.620 --> 19:30.870
Really?

19:32.580 --> 19:33.790
Thank you.

19:37.540 --> 19:38.750
(Peeks Out)
So it's you.

19:38.750 --> 19:40.620
Stop treating her like a target!

19:40.620 --> 19:43.250
Who's that?

19:43.250 --> 19:44.410
She's...

19:44.410 --> 19:45.790
Hello, girls!

19:45.790 --> 19:49.910
I'm Matsu Mizunoe, Ume's sister
and the one who loves him most!

19:49.910 --> 19:51.410
Stop it! You're embarrassing me!

19:51.410 --> 19:52.290
Oh, my!

19:52.290 --> 19:56.000
I'm Terui, Ume's senior,
and I adore him too.

19:56.000 --> 19:57.750
You don't have to play along!

19:57.750 --> 20:00.040
I'm Komaro. I love Ume.

20:00.040 --> 20:01.330
Straight to the point?!

20:01.330 --> 20:03.290
That's quite a claim...

20:03.290 --> 20:05.660
No, those are just polite greetings!

20:05.660 --> 20:09.660
But how much do you know about Ume?

20:10.450 --> 20:12.790
I know everything about him.

20:12.790 --> 20:16.080
From his dick size ten years ago

20:16.080 --> 20:19.120
to his alt account password!

20:19.830 --> 20:22.450
I know how big it is now.

20:22.830 --> 20:24.290
It's huge.

20:24.950 --> 20:26.830
When I sat on it...

20:26.830 --> 20:29.290
Seems you know plenty about Ume.

20:29.830 --> 20:30.790
Huge...

20:30.790 --> 20:31.750
No, that's not what you think!

20:31.750 --> 20:34.000
And that information is completely useless!

20:34.000 --> 20:37.370
But that's just the outside.

20:37.370 --> 20:40.330
Do you know who Ume really is?

20:40.910 --> 20:44.040
For example, he gets lonely very easily.

20:44.040 --> 20:46.330
Back when he couldn't make friends,

20:46.330 --> 20:48.620
he'd soak my chest and clothes with his tears...

20:49.410 --> 20:51.540
He does always look lonely when he's alone,

20:51.540 --> 20:53.830
staring at the door.

20:53.830 --> 20:55.500
That's adorable, too.

20:55.500 --> 20:57.040
Really?

20:57.040 --> 20:58.750
How would you know that?

21:03.830 --> 21:06.580
You girls are amazing!

21:06.580 --> 21:09.830
Not at all. We're enjoying your stories!

21:10.040 --> 21:12.870
They really hit it off talking about Ume.

21:13.200 --> 21:16.120
We should probably get going.

21:16.120 --> 21:18.160
It's almost dinner time.

21:18.160 --> 21:20.540
I see... What a shame.

21:20.540 --> 21:22.330
Ume, walk them out.

21:22.330 --> 21:24.330
Finally, I'm free...

21:24.330 --> 21:27.540
How am I supposed to face them
at school tomorrow?

21:27.540 --> 21:28.660
Oh!

21:29.370 --> 21:31.620
- Was the cake good?
- Yeah, it was.

21:31.620 --> 21:32.700
Ume!

21:34.580 --> 21:36.040
That's good.

21:41.370 --> 21:42.660
Cut it out!

21:43.660 --> 21:45.000
It's embarrassing!

21:54.410 --> 21:56.000
You're so stubborn.

21:58.830 --> 21:59.910
That day,

22:00.160 --> 22:02.790
all of Mizunoe's underwear disappeared.

22:02.790 --> 22:03.830
(See You!)
Bye!

23:35.000 --> 23:36.000
(Even the Student Council Has Its Holes!)
(Next Episode Preview)

23:36.000 --> 23:38.000
(Komaro and the Suggestion Box) (Terui's Secret♪)

23:38.000 --> 23:40.000
(Koki and the Light Music Club)
